🏆 TreasureDAO: {ecosystem.get('treasure_dao_health', 'Unknown')}
⚔️ Bridgeworld: {ecosystem.get('bridgeworld_activity', 'Unknown')}

🔍 PATTERN RECOGNITION:
🎯 Patterns Detected: {patterns.get('total_patterns', 0)}
